`update.mjs` 支持 `--profile`、`--check`、`--json`、`--dry-run`、`--help`。

@sueleven/dsh-auto-update README · English：A DeepSeek Harness plugin that checks your installed-and-enabled plugins for newer versions on every DSH launch, lists what it finds, and updates only after you confirm. Updates go through the official `dsh plugin add` channel and take effect after a restart.

```sh
dsh plugin --profile desktop add @sueleven/dsh-auto-update
